"start": 149, "end": 223, "text": "It first released for Microsoft Windows and Xbox 360 on 18 September 2013."}, "D6S3": {"document_number": 6, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0443-28f5d549a306:d05", "start": 224, "end": 549, "text": "The game was later patched with a build for OS X and Linux on 29 October 2013.<ref name=\"OS X/Linux\"></ref> After a port to PlayStation 4 and PlayStation Vita was announced in mid-2014, the PlayStation 4 received its version of the game on 1 September 2015 in North America as part of the PlayStation Heroes charity campaign."}, "D6S4": {"document_number": 6, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0443-28f5d549a306:d05", "start": 550, "end": 607, "text": "In \"Foul Play\" the player follows the daemon-hunter Baron"}, "D7S1": {"document_number": 7, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0443-28f5d549a306:d06", "start": 0, "end": 116, "text": "Maslin of \"The New York Times\" called the film \"a slick, attractive, enjoyable movie with all the earmarks of a hit."}, "D7S2": {"document_number": 7, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0443-28f5d549a306:d06", "start": 117, "end": 279, "text": "But as \"House Calls\" did a few months ago, it starts out promising genuine wit and originality only to fall back on more familiar tactics after a half-hour or so."}, "D7S3": {"document_number": 7, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0443-28f5d549a306:d06", "start": 280, "end": 386, "text": "If either film had a less winning opening, perhaps it wouldn't leave a vague aftertaste of disappointment."}, "D7S4": {"document_number": 7, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0443-28f5d549a306:d06", "start": 387, "end": 402, "text": "Colin Higgins ."}, "D7S5": {"document_number": 7, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0443-28f5d549a306:d06", "start": 403, "end": 404, "text": "."}, "D7S6": {"document_number": 7, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0443-28f5d549a306:d06", "start": 405, "end": 406, "text": "."}, "D7S7": {"document_number": 7, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0443-28f5d549a306:d06", "start": 407, "end": 551, "text": "has aimed for the same kind of thriller-comedy-romance hybrid he attempted in writing \"Silver Streak\", and this time he's much more successful ."}, "D7S8": {"document_number": 7, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0443-28f5d549a306:d06", "start": 552, "end": 553, "text": "."}, "D7S9": {"document_number": 7, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0443-28f5d549a306:d06", "start": 554, "end": 555, "text": "."}, "D7S10": {"document_number": 7, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0443-28f5d549a306:d06", "start": 556, "end": 566, "text": "Still, Mr."}, "D8S1": {"document_number": 8, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0443-28f5d549a306:d07", "start": 0, "end": 105, "text": "a cocktail laced with Spanish Fly and dances while removing nearly all his clothing to a Bee Gees album ."}, "D8S2": {"document_number": 8, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0443-28f5d549a306:d07", "start": 106, "end": 280, "text": "Shocked by his misunderstanding , Gloria flees and returns to her apartment , where she is attacked by a man with a scar who demands the cigarette pack Scotty had given her ."}, "D8S3": {"document_number": 8, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0443-28f5d549a306:d07", "start": 281, "end": 415, "text": "When he attempts to strangle her with a scarf , Gloria stabs him in the stomach with a pair of knitting needles and calls the police ."}, "D8S4": {"document_number": 8, "doc_id": "ramdocs-0443-28f5d549a306:d07", "start": 416, "end": 514, "text": "When the attacker tries to stop her , he is killed by a knife thrown by Whitey through the kitchen"}}, "candidates": [{"candidate_id": "C0", "answer": "reggae", "card_ids": ["ramdocs-0443-28f5d549a306:d00:c0"]}, {"candidate_id": "C1", "answer": "Country music", "card_ids": ["ramdocs-0443-28f5d549a306:d03:c0"]}, {"candidate_id": "C2", "answer": "Country", "card_ids": ["ramdocs-0443-28f5d549a306:d04:c0"]}, {"candidate_id": "C3", "answer": "brawler action-adventure", "card_ids": ["ramdocs-0443-28f5d549a306:d05:c0"]}, {"candidate_id": "C4", "answer": "thriller-comedy-romance hybrid", "card_ids": ["ramdocs-0443-28f5d549a306:d06:c0"]}], "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "ramdocs-0443-28f5d549a306:d00", "card_id": "ramdocs-0